{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3c915b025611b004a02e86ec3b2c71c7.avif?t=1761407519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras_big/3c915b025611b004a02e86ec3b2c71c7.avif?t=1761407519 width=1560 height=446 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.poster.avif?t=1761407519\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.webm?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.mp4?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin Vs Wutang Legends is the continuation to the indie fighting game series Shaolin vs Wutang 2. This 1-on-1 indie casual combat game showcases hand-to-hand martial arts and weapon combat, licensed music, and stylized graphics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It avoids flashy, over-the-top effects, focusing instead on combat influenced by classic Kung Fu films. The game features authentic fighting sounds, martial arts styles inspired by classic Kung Fu cinema, and a licensed soundtrack with great music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin vs Wutang is a heartfelt tribute to 70s and 80s Kung Fu movies. Created as a passion project by one person with deep knowledge and love for Kung Fu films, it doesn\u2019t aim to compete with big-budget fighting games. Instead, it offers players a nostalgic and satisfying gaming experience reminiscent of the golden era of Kung Fu cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With community support, the goal is to create the ultimate Kung Fu game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current features include:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.poster.avif?t=1761407519\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.webm?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.mp4?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A huge roster with 40 unique fighting styles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Hand-to-hand and weapon-based martial arts combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dynamic blocking animations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A licensed Kung Fu soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- 30 stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Unique moves and combos for every fighter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Single-player and local co-op modes</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win First Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/9b06b5b8e58e7f676a9f9b2ead5e9f4b91379dc1.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Story Mode with one character","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/0e298c973451162c576d5286e45afd0c97ee4b2d.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Story Mode with all characters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/7502360c0d2bd8a26e6f13917559bd9057fafb80.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Story Mode in max difficulty level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/35ad73180798b0f2c0876d62718daf58234e456e.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Story Mode without using any continue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/1b00439703976681b819957e615899362f20207e.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Story Mode without losing any round","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/fa22973053400e7113c0078e736dc1770eeada2f.jpg"},{"name":"Win a round without losing any health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/db2bf8cb86f1de4006a2377efda37c179993a517.jpg"},{"name":"Win a round with less than 10% health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/54196031579b80cfdbf9e323639159a03ec4af35.jpg"},{"name":"10x hit combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/41553f0a9c5b2a151c64f189fb3223b6c6512d62.jpg"},{"name":"Win 10 consecutive games in Versus Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917840/f6e2952769bb5009ad68e028e7308685f3d820aa.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917840?t=1761407519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/e9ef425e8d5211d0f7a914323e78a816345e0121/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761407519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/9b1534f16ca4c8bc89aa72ba34a207151a01acde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761407519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/9b1534f16ca4c8bc89aa72ba34a207151a01acde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761407519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3c915b025611b004a02e86ec3b2c71c7.avif?t=1761407519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras_big/3c915b025611b004a02e86ec3b2c71c7.avif?t=1761407519 width=1560 height=446 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.poster.avif?t=1761407519\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.webm?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/3d1738100a2f4635461daae7c06bf98e.mp4?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin Vs Wutang Legends is the continuation to the indie fighting game series Shaolin vs Wutang 2. This 1-on-1 indie casual combat game showcases hand-to-hand martial arts and weapon combat, licensed music, and stylized graphics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It avoids flashy, over-the-top effects, focusing instead on combat influenced by classic Kung Fu films. The game features authentic fighting sounds, martial arts styles inspired by classic Kung Fu cinema, and a licensed soundtrack with great music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin vs Wutang is a heartfelt tribute to 70s and 80s Kung Fu movies. Created as a passion project by one person with deep knowledge and love for Kung Fu films, it doesn\u2019t aim to compete with big-budget fighting games. Instead, it offers players a nostalgic and satisfying gaming experience reminiscent of the golden era of Kung Fu cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With community support, the goal is to create the ultimate Kung Fu game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current features include:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.poster.avif?t=1761407519\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.webm?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/extras/9377f9bd3c90e017eea92817e71c16f9.mp4?t=1761407519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A huge roster with 40 unique fighting styles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Hand-to-hand and weapon-based martial arts combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dynamic blocking animations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A licensed Kung Fu soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- 30 stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Unique moves and combos for every fighter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Single-player and local co-op modes</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["J.Bowman"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917840/8083f64cd0f6e3fe59c940ea0a540d859fe26454/header.jpg?t=1761407519","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3917840/2065522799/c9e6a39fdd52c6df469e2811816132ef404a2f98/1756176673/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756180031","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3917840/2065522799/c9e6a39fdd52c6df469e2811816132ef404a2f98/1756176673/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756180031","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3917840/2065522799/c9e6a39fdd52c6df469e2811816132ef404a2f98/1756176673/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756180031","id":257179566,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179566/f28b69a99e2828ed30b7173c3e6574edaad4eda7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756180031"}],"name":"Shaolin vs Wutang Legends","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Shaolin Vs Wutang Legends - $19.99 USD","packageid":1376726,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1999}],"title":"Buy Shaolin vs Wutang Legends"}],"pa